<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:31,020 --> 00:01:32,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That form...?!</font>

26
00:02:13,690 --> 00:02:18,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's the extent of
the rumored "Absolute Defense"?</font>

27
00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:24,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How disappointing.</font>

28
00:02:34,630 --> 00:02:37,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... You were wearing sand, eh?</font>

29
00:02:38,590 --> 00:02:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your opponent's not just him!</font>

30
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm here too!</font>

31
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:02,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-That attack just now...</font>

32
00:03:02,410 --> 00:03:05,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would've been dangerous
had I not been protected by sand.</font>

33
00:03:07,870 --> 00:03:10,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-My body is still...</font>

34
00:03:12,250 --> 00:03:15,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll just be a hindrance like this.</font>

35
00:03:18,090 --> 00:03:19,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Annoying sand...</font>

36
00:03:21,010 --> 00:03:23,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're first, Gaara.</font>

37
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:46,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He yanked out his spinal column?!</font>

38
00:03:50,330 --> 00:03:55,880
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{An Implacable Punch!</font>

39
00:03:50,330 --> 00:03:55,880
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{Dance of the</font>

40
00:03:50,330 --> 00:03:55,880
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{Seedling Fern</font>

41
00:04:01,550 --> 00:04:03,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dance of the Clematis Flower.</font>

42
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Vine!</font>

43
00:04:16,230 --> 00:04:17,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Flower!</font>

44
00:04:23,530 --> 00:04:25,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A bone of the strongest calcification...</font>

45
00:04:27,410 --> 00:04:31,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will pierce you,
sand defense and all...</font>

46
00:04:33,250 --> 00:04:34,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No time... huh?</font>

47
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:45,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ultimate Defense: Shukaku's Shield!</font>

48
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:56,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto...</font>

49
00:04:56,650 --> 00:04:59,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How much longer will
Kimimaro hold out for?</font>

50
00:04:59,770 --> 00:05:02,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think he should still
be okay for a while...</font>

51
00:05:05,570 --> 00:05:07,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did all I could with the treatment...</font>

52
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:12,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there's not nearly enough
information about his body.</font>

53
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:17,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think it'd be quite different
if we had something</font>

54
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:20,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like the medical history
and treatment data of his clan.</font>

55
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:24,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What came out after looking into it</font>

56
00:05:24,590 --> 00:05:33,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was the bloody history of how
the Kaguya Clan became just him...</font>

57
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:45,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fools who provoked the great land of
the Village Hidden in the Mist into battle</font>

58
00:05:45,490 --> 00:05:47,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with just their clan
and were annihilated.</font>

59
00:05:50,870 --> 00:05:55,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Kaguya Clan was
a foolish clan that liked battle.</font>

60
00:05:56,040 --> 00:06:00,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The battlefield was the only place
where they could be at peace.</font>

61
00:06:01,340 --> 00:06:04,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it was long ago when
a simple-minded group</font>

62
00:06:04,130 --> 00:06:07,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that only enjoyed slaughter
was acceptable...</font>

63
00:06:08,470 --> 00:06:10,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The times are different now.</font>

64
00:06:11,100 --> 00:06:14,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doing something like fighting
only with power</font>

65
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:17,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">against a governed organization
like the Mist...</font>

66
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:21,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">can only be called an act of fools
rushing towards death.</font>

67
00:06:23,650 --> 00:06:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then you saved only he
who was the youngest</font>

68
00:06:27,190 --> 00:06:31,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the most exceptional
among the Kaguya Clan...</font>

69
00:06:34,910 --> 00:06:40,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kid possessed the power that
would be feared even by the fighting clan.</font>

70
00:06:40,710 --> 00:06:44,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it seems he was kept
in prison the whole time.</font>

71
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would've been a waste to let him... die.</font>

72
00:06:49,050 --> 00:06:53,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who wouldn't want
that rare Kekkei Genkai?</font>

73
00:06:54,220 --> 00:06:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He possesses a strong
and firm bone structure</font>

74
00:06:56,470 --> 00:07:00,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and a defensive power to
repel all kinds of physical attacks.</font>

75
00:07:00,850 --> 00:07:03,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if turned to offense...</font>

76
00:07:04,150 --> 00:07:07,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the bones become
a most powerful weapon.</font>

77
00:07:18,830 --> 00:07:21,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because I've fought him once
that I understand this.</font>

78
00:07:21,290 --> 00:07:24,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That sand shield is
an absolute defense no less.</font>

79
00:07:24,790 --> 00:07:27,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that unusual form...</font>

80
00:07:27,460 --> 00:07:29,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be okay.
There's no way it'll be broken!</font>

81
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:10,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's hard...</font>

82
00:08:11,010 --> 00:08:14,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I gathered minerals with
great hardness from the ground,</font>

83
00:08:14,180 --> 00:08:18,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">applied pressure with Chakra
and mixed them into the sand.</font>

84
00:08:26,900 --> 00:08:30,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... that unusual Jutsu...</font>

85
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:33,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the Kekkei Genkai, right?</font>

86
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:35,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Kaguya Clan...</font>

87
00:08:36,530 --> 00:08:40,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The ability which now
only I possess.</font>

88
00:08:40,620 --> 00:08:42,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The last one of the clan, eh?</font>

89
00:08:43,410 --> 00:08:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then it'll die out here today.</font>

90
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:50,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed that might happen.</font>

91
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:55,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Due to sickness
my body will not last so long...</font>

92
00:08:56,340 --> 00:09:00,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the clan will not die out.</font>

93
00:09:03,180 --> 00:09:06,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides I'm not alone.</font>

94
00:09:16,860 --> 00:09:19,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the "Earth" Curse Mark...</font>

95
00:09:19,990 --> 00:09:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this...</font>

96
00:09:21,330 --> 00:09:23,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can become a part of you,
Orochimaru-sama.</font>

97
00:09:24,660 --> 00:09:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's get everything, Kimimaro.</font>

98
00:09:28,380 --> 00:09:32,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And let's see the truth of
this world together.</font>

99
00:09:33,300 --> 00:09:34,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

100
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're my "Vessel of Dreams."</font>

101
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you.</font>

102
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:46,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are presents from me.
I hope you like them.</font>

103
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:03,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Would you rather... die or obey?</font>

104
00:10:04,250 --> 00:10:05,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Obey...</font>

105
00:10:05,830 --> 00:10:07,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will!</font>

106
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:26,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this the best a team
of four can do?</font>

107
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:32,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll ask just once more...</font>

108
00:10:33,230 --> 00:10:34,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which would you rather choose?</font>

109
00:10:40,610 --> 00:10:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Very well...</font>

110
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:44,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As of now we're the Sound Ninja Five.</font>

111
00:10:52,630 --> 00:10:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not alone you said...?</font>

112
00:10:54,710 --> 00:10:55,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

113
00:10:56,300 --> 00:11:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As an existence shouldering
one part of Orochimaru-sama's ambition...</font>

114
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:06,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will remain inside
Orochimaru-sama's soul...</font>

115
00:11:06,310 --> 00:11:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for all eternity.</font>

116
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:12,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru's brainwashing, huh...?</font>

117
00:11:13,690 --> 00:11:15,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a pitiful guy.</font>

118
00:11:26,450 --> 00:11:30,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I used my big moves too much.
I don't have much Chakra.</font>

119
00:11:30,790 --> 00:11:32,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the last of it.</font>

120
00:11:41,050 --> 00:11:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What an amount of Chakra...</font>

121
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:56,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are something...</font>

122
00:12:01,530 --> 00:12:05,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll sink and confine you
200 meters into the ground.</font>

123
00:12:05,570 --> 00:12:08,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the pressure of the sand
stuck to your body</font>

124
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:11,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'll soon be unable to move
not even a finger...</font>

125
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:29,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did it...!
This time for sure you did it.</font>

126
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:40,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dance...</font>

127
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:43,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bracken Dance!</font>

128
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is annoying...</font>

129
00:13:08,930 --> 00:13:11,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It feels like a long time</font>

130
00:13:11,390 --> 00:13:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when waiting eagerly for
something you want.</font>

131
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:15,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto...</font>

132
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop talking like
you're humoring a child!</font>

133
00:13:20,070 --> 00:13:21,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

134
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you should know
this the most, Orochimaru-sama.</font>

135
00:13:27,660 --> 00:13:29,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nobody can beat Kimimaro,</font>

136
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:32,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no matter what hindrance
should appear.</font>

137
00:13:37,370 --> 00:13:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for saving me...</font>

138
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Being able to do something like this,
very impressive.</font>

139
00:13:43,090 --> 00:13:45,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All I did was ride the sand
I'm always controlling.</font>

140
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:48,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You just have to know how you use it.</font>

141
00:13:52,510 --> 00:13:53,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama...</font>

142
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:59,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Orochimaru-sama...</font>

143
00:14:08,660 --> 00:14:11,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At last... The destruction of
the Leaf will begin...</font>

144
00:14:11,870 --> 00:14:15,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Third Hokage...
I'll teach you a thing or two.</font>

145
00:14:29,300 --> 00:14:30,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to keep you waiting.</font>

146
00:14:37,730 --> 00:14:39,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Kimimaro-kun?</font>

147
00:14:41,730 --> 00:14:43,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... It's nothing.</font>

148
00:14:56,330 --> 00:14:58,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even the Kazekage of
the Hidden Sand Village</font>

149
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:02,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is no match against us.</font>

150
00:15:05,750 --> 00:15:07,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course...</font>

151
00:15:08,470 --> 00:15:11,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kimimaro, it's thanks to you...</font>

152
00:15:14,300 --> 00:15:15,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kimimaro-kun!</font>

153
00:15:15,470 --> 00:15:18,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kimimaro, so you can't go on, huh?</font>

154
00:15:20,560 --> 00:15:23,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Orochimaru-sama.</font>

155
00:15:35,030 --> 00:15:37,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can't be of use...</font>

156
00:15:39,750 --> 00:15:41,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then there's no significance
to my living.</font>

157
00:15:45,790 --> 00:15:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How is your condition, Kimimaro-kun?</font>

158
00:15:49,170 --> 00:15:52,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The "Destruction of the Leaf"
resulted in an unfortunate near miss,</font>

159
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but the Sound Ninja Four
have gone to pick up a new vessel...</font>

160
00:16:00,230 --> 00:16:03,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama's new
"Vessel of Dreams."</font>

161
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:09,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru's brainwashing, huh...?</font>

162
00:16:11,150 --> 00:16:12,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a pitiful guy...</font>

163
00:16:14,030 --> 00:16:16,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're wrong... Far from it!</font>

164
00:16:17,370 --> 00:16:21,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no significance to living...</font>

165
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:27,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... you might be able to discover
something interesting</font>

166
00:16:27,670 --> 00:16:29,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by continuing to live...</font>

167
00:16:31,050 --> 00:16:34,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like how you discovered that flower...</font>

168
00:16:36,470 --> 00:16:39,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like how I discovered you.</font>

169
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:45,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the "Earth" Curse Mark!</font>

170
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:50,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this... I can become
a part of you, Orochimaru-sama.</font>

171
00:16:50,730 --> 00:16:54,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's get everything, Kimimaro...</font>

172
00:16:54,740 --> 00:16:58,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And let's see the truth of
this world together.</font>

173
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:09,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to discover
the truth of this world!</font>

174
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:13,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With Orochimaru-sama!</font>

175
00:17:20,470 --> 00:17:23,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was a persistent guy
but this is the end.</font>

176
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He won't ever come out again.</font>

177
00:17:27,810 --> 00:17:28,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Right...</font>

178
00:17:33,740 --> 00:17:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't go on...</font>

179
00:17:35,990 --> 00:17:37,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're getting off...</font>

180
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:39,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not brainwashing!</font>

181
00:17:41,620 --> 00:17:46,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That person...
Orochimaru-sama understands me!</font>

182
00:17:49,540 --> 00:17:52,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you guys know?!</font>

183
00:18:16,650 --> 00:18:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's dead...</font>

184
00:18:21,620 --> 00:18:24,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be? Has Kimimaro...?</font>

185
00:18:25,540 --> 00:18:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The likes of Kimimaro makes
no difference now...</font>

186
00:18:31,170 --> 00:18:35,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... I can hardly wait for him.</font>

187
00:18:36,590 --> 00:18:40,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll come here even by himself...</font>

188
00:18:44,100 --> 00:18:46,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would have been totally hammered.</font>

189
00:18:47,930 --> 00:18:49,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not the case.</font>

190
00:18:50,100 --> 00:18:52,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My sensei said it often...</font>

191
00:18:52,980 --> 00:18:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Luck is also a part of strength.</font>

192
00:18:55,610 --> 00:18:57,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That backseat driver?</font>

193
00:18:57,900 --> 00:18:59,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not a backseat driver!</font>

194
00:19:00,530 --> 00:19:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because...</font>

195
00:19:04,950 --> 00:19:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wasn't good enough at that time!</font>

196
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:13,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm grateful for you saving me.</font>

197
00:19:14,210 --> 00:19:17,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But please don't talk like that
about my sensei!</font>

198
00:19:19,840 --> 00:19:21,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You too...?</font>

199
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you feel that</font>

200
00:19:25,310 --> 00:19:28,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the honor of someone you revere
has been hurt,</font>

201
00:19:28,390 --> 00:19:30,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you yourself are hurt badly
and become enraged.</font>

202
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:33,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The more important the person
you revere is to you,</font>

203
00:19:33,860 --> 00:19:35,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the greater the feeling...</font>

204
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The clan won't die out...
I'm not alone.</font>

205
00:19:40,110 --> 00:19:44,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will remain inside
Orochimaru-sama's soul for all eternity.</font>

206
00:19:44,450 --> 00:19:48,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That person
Orochimaru-sama, understands me!</font>

207
00:19:49,580 --> 00:19:52,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you guys know?!</font>

208
00:19:54,380 --> 00:19:57,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fighting for the sake of someone
important to you...</font>

209
00:19:59,340 --> 00:20:04,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was also the same
as Uzumaki Naruto...</font>

210
00:20:06,810 --> 00:20:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... the person who is important
to oneself</font>

211
00:20:10,390 --> 00:20:12,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">might not always be "virtuous."</font>

212
00:20:13,020 --> 00:20:14,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder...</font>

213
00:20:14,730 --> 00:20:18,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way someone evil
can be thought of as an important person.</font>

214
00:20:18,610 --> 00:20:22,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. Even if you know they're "evil"...</font>

215
00:20:24,950 --> 00:20:27,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People can't defeat solitude...</font>

216
00:20:43,590 --> 00:20:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

