259
00:22:37,330 --> 00:22:38,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You gotta be kidding me!</font>

260
00:22:38,870 --> 00:22:41,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What do you mean
"for achieving your goal"?!</font>

261
00:22:41,170 --> 00:22:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Orochimaru wants you
only as a "vessel"!</font>

262
00:22:45,670 --> 00:22:48,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">There's no way
I can let you go to him!</font>

263
00:22:49,340 --> 00:22:50,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">This is no joke!</font>

264
00:22:51,220 --> 00:22:58,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">If you insist on going
I have to take you back by force!</font>

265
00:22:59,310 --> 00:23:01,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
